   "texts": {
    "MossdeepCity_Text_SpecialSpaceCenterRock": "This rock has a special meaning to\\nthe people at the SPACE CENTER.\\pThey put it here as their wish for\\ntheir rockets to fly safely.\\pWhen you make a wish, what do you use?\\nDo you wish upon a star?\\pI use a wish tag to make it happen.\\nThat's what I do.$"
