   "script": "MossdeepCity_EventScript_DynamicPunchTutor",
   "texts": {
    "MoveTutor_Text_DynamicPunchTeach": "I can't do this anymore!\\pIt's utterly hopeless!\\pI'm a FIGHTING-type TRAINER,\\nso I can't win at the MOSSDEEP GYM\\lno matter how hard I try!\\pArgh! Punch! Punch! Punch!\\nPunch! Punch! Punch!\\pWhat, don't look at me that way!\\nI'm only hitting the ground!\\pOr do you want me to teach your\\nPOKéMON DYNAMICPUNCH?$",
    "MoveTutor_Text_DynamicPunchWhichMon": "What? You do? You're a good person!\\nWhich POKéMON should I teach?$"
   },
